#: source/policy_deployment/index.rst:2
msgid "Sim2Real Deployment of Policies Trained in Isaac Lab"
msgstr "Isaac Lab 训练策略的仿真到现实部署"

#: source/policy_deployment/index.rst:4
msgid ""
"Train and export policies, check them in simulation, and deploy them on "
"robots. The guides below cover task-specific configuration and deployment "
"tools."
msgstr "训练并导出策略，在仿真中检查，再部署到机器人。以下指南介绍任务专用配置及部署工具。"
